// Go workspace for TwoPlacePaste.
//
// SHARED TOUCHPOINT (ROADMAP §3): changes to this file are always their own PR,
// owned by Phase 0. Feature phases must not edit it; they open a
// `contract-change` issue instead.
//
// The version is written as 1.26.0 rather than 1.26 on purpose: a workspace
// version must be at least the highest one any member module declares, and a
// dependency that requires `go >= 1.26.0` forces its module's directive to the
// three-part form. Written as `1.26`, this file would reject that module.
go 1.26.0

use (
	./desktop
	./pkg/tppclient
	./server
)
